WEBVTT

00:16:58.263 --> 00:17:00.976
So, I started to really
get really paranoid.

00:17:02.031 --> 00:17:04.942
Then at 13 minutes, maybe
because of the hypochondria,

00:17:04.966 --> 00:17:08.976
I started feeling pains all over my chest.

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:10.053
It was awful.

00:17:10.077 --> 00:17:11.078
(Laughter)

00:17:11.102 --> 00:17:14.976
At 14 minutes,
I had these awful contractions,

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:16.976
like this urge to breathe.

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:19.642
(Laughter)

00:17:22.871 --> 00:17:23.871
(Laughter ends)

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:29.976
At 15 minutes I was suffering
major O2 deprivation to the heart.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:32.976
And I started having
ischemia to the heart.